WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Claude has made a change

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.500
C-c c D D opens the review of what the session changed, here in ediff

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:13.400
T asks for a tour: comments appear under the lines, Claude's words in the pane

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.600
t goes to the next stop

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:23.200
c on Claude's comment replies to it

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:26.800
C-c C-c sends the reply, and the review stays open

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:31.100
Claude answers under your comment and changes the file

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:35.100
The review reads the file again and shows the new difference
